---
/* QuotePieces.astro - two small pieces the quotation engine needs at the
   bottom of the page:

   #bar    the black "Estimate: GH₵… | View estimate" bar that appears on
           phones once something has been added.
   #quote  the hidden A4 quotation. quote-engine.js fills it in; print.css
           makes it the ONLY thing that prints. It must stay a direct child
           of <body> (the print rules and the tests depend on that), so this
           component is placed straight inside <body> in index.astro. */
---
<div class="bar noprint" id="bar"><b id="barTxt"></b><button id="barBtn">View estimate</button></div>

<section id="quote" aria-hidden="true"></section>
